=== Perks ===

Perks are taken from vending machines. They are lost on death. Each perk type has a fixed price. The Randomized Vending Machines option shuffles locations.

Purchased perks show a HUD icon. Grants the 5th Perk Slot, Random Perk, and Removes ALL your perks have no icon.

