=== World store ===

The world is enrolled in the [[Special:MyLanguage/Creator Economy|Creator Economy]]. The world store sells these listings for [[Special:MyLanguage/Creator Economy#VRChat Credits|VRChat Credits]]:

* '''TEC-9''', 350 credits, permanent. Starting-pistol skin that replaces the M1911.
* '''Mauser M712''', 600 credits, permanent. Starting-pistol skin that replaces the M1911.
* '''Luger P08''', 600 credits, permanent. Starting-pistol skin that replaces the M1911.
* '''BB Gun''', 600 credits, permanent. Unlocks the BB Gun.

Supporters have weapon skins, laser sight colors, weapon shaders, and a name on the supporter board. Those are not world-store listings.

== History ==

The world entered [[Special:MyLanguage/Community Labs|Community Labs]] on {{Date|2022-12-31}} and published on {{Date|2023-10-20}}.

It appeared under Scary Worlds in [[Special:MyLanguage/Spookality 2023|Spookality 2023]].

The April Fools 2025 [[Special:MyLanguage/List of April Fools' Day jokes#VRRat Community Takeover|VRRat Community Takeover]] listed it as Rat Survival.

